<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Bled Guide: 11 places – lake in the morning mist, Ojstrica, Vintgar Gorge &amp; Bohinj – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. The lake in the morning mist</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · A walk around the lake takes about 1.5 to 2 hours. The pletna rowers take you to the island; according to legend they got their privilege from Empress Maria Theresa. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>14.09381,46.36391,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Bled Castle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Around 10 am it is calmer than at midday. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>14.10052,46.3697,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Pletna boat to the island</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go early in the morning and ring the wishing bell. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>14.09974,46.36056,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Vintgar Gorge</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>14.09275,46.39862,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Bled cream cake</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Prices at the lakeside café are upscale – one slice is enough for the view. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>14.10862,46.36759,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Lake Bohinj</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Plan half a day and swim in the lake. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>13.86453,46.28227,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Savica waterfall</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Wear sturdy shoes. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>13.79631,46.29316,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Triglav National Park &amp; hikes</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Plan tours according to weather and fitness. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/bled/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>13.81387,46.33605,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
